    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not like high school. i've been through a lot more than that. i've seen things that make all this stuff—the jobs, the social ladder, the small talk—it all feels so fake. like i'm standing on a different plane of existence. i saw real things, real sacrifices, and now i'm just back here pretending to be part of a world that doesn't even make sense anymore. it's like i've already died and i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
